From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Micheal Waltz <micheal@ecliptik.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:06:35 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] psDooM: processes as monsters, through libpsd

Hooks for the psdoom-plus glue (engines/common/psdoom in the psdoom-plus
tree), generated by tools/apply-woof-hooks.py: pid monsters and their
floating labels, damage/renice and death/kill, -respawnitems,
-nomonsters., the custom level, and psDooM's options in the command-line
check. Keyframes (saves and rewind) keep each monster's pid, and
PS_Resync() re-adopts them after a load.
---
 src/d_main.c   |  3 +++
 src/g_game.c   |  5 +++++
 src/g_rewind.c |  2 ++
 src/kf_file.c  |  2 ++
 src/m_argv.c   |  9 +++++++++
 src/mn_menu.c  |  4 ++--
 src/p_inter.c  | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 src/p_mobj.c   |  4 +++-
